course: dictionary
lesson: 3324
title: The eve before the big day
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Eve is a short word with a clear main meaning: the day or evening before a special day. «Christmas Eve» is the evening before Christmas Day, and «New Year's Eve» is the night before the New Year starts.
explain: Look at the words around it. «On the eve of the match» tells you the match is coming soon, so eve means the time just before an important event. Ask: what would fit here? Then try your meaning in the sentence to check it.
explain: Watch for a capital letter. Eve with a capital E is a girl's name. «The serpent persuaded Eve that God was keeping something good from her» shows Eve is a person, not a day, so the clue is the capital letter and the story around it.
fact: Eve means the day or evening before a special day.
fact: «Christmas Eve» and «New Year's Eve» are the evenings before Christmas and the New Year.
fact: «On the eve of» means just before an important event.
fact: In old or poetry English, eve can also mean evening.
fact: Eve with a capital letter is a girl's name; in the Bible, Eve is the first woman.
exercise: «The night before, chúxī, New Year's Eve, is the big one.» What does chúxī mean? | A dumpling | Christmas Day | Happy New Year | *New Year's Eve
exercise: «We were nervous on the eve of the match.» What does eve mean here? | *The time just before the match | A girl's name | The evening meal | The day after the match
exercise: «The serpent persuaded Eve that God was keeping something good from her.» Who is Eve here? | The night before a feast | A type of dumpling | The evening meal | *The first woman in the Bible
test: «Christmas Eve» is the day before what? | Boxing Day | *Christmas Day | Bonfire Night | New Year's Day
test: In an old poem, «the eve» means | Winter | *Evening | Morning | Midnight
exam: Read: «Eve was the first woman in the Bible.» What does Eve mean here? | Midnight | The day before a feast | *A girl's name | Evening
